1.1 kubesphere/notification-manager
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  License : Apache License 2.0 (full text in third_party/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt)
  Source  : https://github.com/kubesphere/notification-manager
  Files   : pkg/notify/notifier/email/email.go  (lines 284-328)
  Used in : internal/channel/email/compose.go

  What was taken — the ENCODING POLICY, not the bytes:

    - non-ASCII headers are Q-encoded (mime.QEncoding)
    - every MIME part declares charset=UTF-8
    - the body is quoted-printable encoded
    - the plain-text part precedes the HTML part in multipart/alternative,
      so a reader picks the richest part it can render

  What was NOT taken:

    - the upstream SMTP client (dialling, TLS negotiation, AUTH). This project
      uses github.com/wneessen/go-mail for transport instead.
    - the upstream single-part body. Upstream declares multipart/alternative
      but emits one part; this project emits both, which is what gives an HTML
      notification a readable fallback in a text-only client.

  Modifications: adapted to this project's Channel interface and Message model.
  See the provenance header at the top of internal/channel/email/compose.go.


